#. ja: 不純物を取り除き、採集アイテムの収集価値を上昇させる。<br>収集価値上昇量：プレイヤーの獲得力に応じて増加。<br>耐久を1消費する。
#. de: Du erhöhst den Sammlerwert des Gegenstands.<br>Sammlerwertsteigerung: Abhängig von deinem Sammelgeschick.<br>Reduziert die Belastbarkeit um 1.
#. fr: Augmente la valeur de collection d'un objet en fonction de votre Collecte.<br>Coûte une tentative de récolte.
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "ActionTransient:22182:0:0"
msgid "Increases collectability of an item. Increase is determined by your <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>gathering</ui-edge-color></ui-color> rating.<br>Reduces integrity by 1."
msgstr "Повышает коллекционную ценность предмета в зависимости от вашего <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>навыка собирательства</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Снижает прочность на 1."

#. ja: 不純物を取り除き、採集アイテムの収集価値を上昇させる。<br>収集価値上昇量：「純化」の50～150％（ランダム）<br>耐久を1消費する。
#. de: Du erhöhst den Sammlerwert des Gegenstands.<br>Sammlerwertsteigerung: 50<nbsp>% bis 150<nbsp>% von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Lese</ui-edge-color></ui-color> (zufällig)<br>Reduziert die Belastbarkeit um 1.
#. fr: Augmente la valeur de collection d'un objet.<br>Le montant est déterminé aléatoirement et oscille entre 50% et 150% de celui octroyé par Sélection.<br>Coûte une tentative de récolte.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "ActionTransient:22183:0:0"
msgid "Increases the collectability of an item. Increase is a random amount ranging from 50% to 150% of the effectiveness of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Scour</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Reduces integrity by 1."
msgstr "Повышает коллекционную ценность предмета. Прирост случайный: от 50% до 150% от эффекта действия <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Очистка»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Снижает прочность на 1."

#. ja: 不純物を取り除き、採集アイテムの収集価値を上昇させる。<br>収集価値上昇量：「純化」の75％<br>耐久を1消費する。<br>（ただし、消費しないこともある。その発生率はプレイヤーの獲得力に応じて増加）
#. de: Du erhöhst den Sammlerwert des Gegenstands.<br>Sammlerwertsteigerung: 75<nbsp>% von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Lese</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Je nach deiner Wahrnehmung steigt die Chance, dass keine Belastbarkeit verbraucht wird.
#. fr: Augmente la valeur de collection d'un objet.<br>Le montant est égal à 75% de celui octroyé par Sélection.<br>Coûte une tentative de récolte, mais a une chance de n'en coûter aucune (pourcentage déterminé par votre Collecte).
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "ActionTransient:22184:0:0"
msgid "Increases collectability of an item. Increase is 75% of the effectiveness of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Scour</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Reduces integrity by 1. There is a chance integrity is unaffected, determined by your <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>gathering</ui-edge-color></ui-color> rating."
msgstr "Повышает коллекционную ценность предмета на 75% от эффекта действия <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Очистка»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Снижает прочность на 1. Прочность может не снизиться; шанс этого зависит от вашего <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>навыка собирательства</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: 次に使用する純化アクションの、収集価値上昇量をブーストする。<br>プレイヤーの技術力に応じて、ブースト率が増加。
#. de: Du erhöhst die sammlerwertsteigernde Wirkung des nächsten <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Lese</ui-edge-color></ui-color>-Kommandos. Je höher deine Expertise, desto stärker der Effekt.
#. fr: Améliore l'efficacité de votre prochaine action de type Sélection.<br>Le montant est déterminé par votre Savoir-faire.
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "ActionTransient:22185:0:0"
msgid "Improves next item collectability increase. Effect is determined by your <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>perception</ui-edge-color></ui-color> rating."
msgstr "Увеличивает прирост коллекционной ценности следующего предмета в зависимости от вашего показателя <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>восприятия</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

