msgctxt "ActionTransient:22352:0:0"
msgid "Consumes MP to deal unaspected damage with a potency of 300 to all nearby enemies.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Unaspected damage over time<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 350<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 60s<br>The damage over time effect of Lost Flare Star can only be applied once per target at any given time. This effect cannot be stacked by multiple players."
